},{"text":"Measure BB makes life in Pacifica less affordable.","x":226,"y":562,"w":1016,"h":39},{"text":"Measure BB is a NEW Sales Tax. You'd pay this ADDITIONAL ONE PERCENT ( 1% ) TAX on","x":226,"y":673,"w":1980,"h":52},{"text":"most things you buy.","x":225,"y":728,"w":417,"h":46},{"text":"Electronics, appliances, prepared food (including restaurant meals), and online purchases will cost","x":224,"y":838,"w":1890,"h":53},{"text":"more. Every gallon of gas will cost another nickel.","x":223,"y":894,"w":980,"h":46},{"text":"This permanent sales tax hike goes into the unrestricted General Fund. City Hall can spend it on","x":223,"y":1005,"w":1984,"h":53},{"text":"anything they want — no matter what voters were told it was for.","x":223,"y":1060,"w":1328,"h":45},{"text":"There's no guarantee how they'll use the taken from you. Measure BB doesn't","x":221,"y":1170,"w":1875,"h":50},{"text":"require that police or fire services will be funded or potholes will be filled.","x":221,"y":1225,"w":1429,"h":49},{"text":"Vote NO on Measure BB because:","x":220,"y":1335,"w":688,"h":37},{"text":"It's too big. It's the largest sales tax increase in Pacifica's history.","x":363,"y":1393,"w":1324,"h":52},{"text":"It's permanent. It'll make ours Northern California's highest sales tax rate.","x":363,"y":1452,"w":1529,"h":50},{"text":"It's a \"blank check\" City Hall can spend on anything they choose, no matter what you're","x":363,"y":1510,"w":1786,"h":54},{"text":"promised.","x":361,"y":1565,"w":186,"h":47},{"text":"It's a regressive tax. It hits seniors and working families hardest.","x":362,"y":1626,"w":1318,"h":48},{"text":"Pacifica is mismanaged. City Hall says it's broke — but it just built a $12,000,000 Civic","x":361,"y":1683,"w":1719,"h":51},{"text":"Center and pays 28 employees over $250,000 each in pay/benefits. That's three times what the","x":362,"y":1739,"w":1810,"h":50},{"text":"average adult here earns.","x":361,"y":1793,"w":474,"h":46},{"text":"There's no \"oversight\". The word doesn't appear anywhere in the ordinance.","x":360,"y":1852,"w":1467,"h":50},{"text":"VOTE NO 0N MEASURE BB.","x":216,"y":1963,"w":642,"h":37},{"text":"NoForeverTax.com","x":216,"y":2018,"w":389,"h":36}]},{"page":2,"width":2448,"height":3168,"lines":[{"text":"cory","x":375,"y":46,"w":130,"h":51},{"text":"RECEIVED","x":2062,"y":51,"w":215,"h":42},{"text":"AUG 17 2026","x":2038,"y":141,"w":255,"h":50},{"text":"1","x":146,"y":281,"w":12,"h":35},{"text":"2","x":141,"y":335,"w":21,"h":35},{"text":"3","x":140,"y":391,"w":19,"h":35},{"text":"4","x":139,"y":446,"w":22,"h":35},{"text":"5","x":140,"y":501,"w":19,"h":35},{"text":"6","x":139,"y":556,"w":21,"h":35},{"text":"7","x":138,"y":611,"w":21,"h":35},{"text":"8","x":139,"y":666,"w":19,"h":36},{"text":"9","x":137,"y":722,"w":21,"h":36},{"text":"10","x":115,"y":777,"w":43,"h":35},{"text":"11","x":115,"y":833,"w":38,"h":36},{"text":"12","x":114,"y":888,"w":43,"h":35},{"text":"13","x":114,"y":943,"w":40,"h":36},{"text":"14","x":114,"y":999,"w":41,"h":35},{"text":"15","x":112,"y":1054,"w":42,"h":35},{"text":"16","x":112,"y":1108,"w":42,"h":36},{"text":"17","x":111,"y":1164,"w":43,"h":36},{"text":"18","x":111,"y":1219,"w":42,"h":35},{"text":"19","x":110,"y":1274,"w":43,"h":35},{"text":"20","x":105,"y":1328,"w":48,"h":36},{"text":"21","x":105,"y":1387,"w":42,"h":35},{"text":"22","x":104,"y":1445,"w":47,"h":35},{"text":"23","x":103,"y":1504,"w":46,"h":35},{"text":"24","x":103,"y":1559,"w":48,"h":36},{"text":"25","x":102,"y":1618,"w":47,"h":36},{"text":"26","x":102,"y":1676,"w":48,"h":36},{"text":"27","x":102,"y":1732,"w":47,"h":35},{"text":"28","x":101,"y":1787,"w":47,"h":35},{"text":"29","x":100,"y":1846,"w":48,"h":35},{"text":"30","x":101,"y":1900,"w":46,"h":36},{"text":"31","x":100,"y":1956,"w":42,"h":35},{"text":"32","x":99,"y":2010,"w":47,"h":35},{"text":"VOTE NO ON MEASURE BB. STOP PACIFICA'S HUGE NEW \"FOREVER\" SALESGIIRQPLERC¯","x":237,"y":253,"w":2107,"h":69},{"text":"Measure BB raises Pacifica's sales tax 